{"id":"n58495-3-6","stage":3,"title":"벗어나다 · 摆脱","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58495-3-6-1","ko":"오늘로 시험도 다 끝이야!","zh":"今天考试就全部结束了！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘로","meaning":"今天","explanation":"오늘：今天；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68207","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘로","audio":"/audio/22417b175a9c4a7d72a4.mp3"}},{"text":"시험도","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험도","audio":"/audio/7e74eb89e2364b408ea2.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"끝이야!","meaning":"终，完，完毕","explanation":"끝：终，完，完毕；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"끝","audio":"/audio/fa22cdfb3221d82b98bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48072","senseId":"5","lemma":"끝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝이야","audio":"/audio/a80076af7fcfbc70ee84.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68207","definition":"在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"fa22cdfb3221d82b","